{"componentChunkName":"component---src-pages-new-projects-js","path":"new-projects/mareva-emaar-properties-the-oasis","result":{"serverData":{"data":{"status":true,"message":"Property details fetch successfully","data":{"id":1352,"crm_id":"196","search_type":"sales","department":"new_developments","status":null,"title":"Mareva","slug":"mareva-emaar-properties-the-oasis","display_address":"The Oasis","building_type":["villa"],"completion_year":"2030","developer":"Emaar Properties","price":13470000,"display_price":"13.47M","lattitude":25.0474505,"longitude":55.2074301,"min_bedrooms":4,"max_bedrooms":6,"display_bedrooms":null,"about":"<p>Mareva at <a target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" href=\"https://providentestate.com/area-guides/the-oasis-by-emaar/\">The Oasis</a> introduces a collection of 311 standalone villas immersed in serene waterways, verdant landscapes, and resort-style luxury. Featuring <strong>4, 5 and 6-bedroom residences</strong>, the community blends natural light, contemporary architecture, and water-inspired elegance, creating a refined living experience with strong ROI potential. A swimmable lagoon, community parks, playgrounds, and dedicated wellness areas enhance its tranquil atmosphere.</p><p>At Mareva by <a target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" href=\"https://providentestate.com/new-projects/developed-by-emaar-properties/\">Emaar Properties</a>, each villa is designed as a private sanctuary surrounded by lush greenery, calm vistas, and pathways for wellness and leisure. Residents enjoy jogging and cycling tracks, spa facilities, sports amenities, and thoughtfully planned open spaces. With an attractive 10% down payment, Mareva offers a prospect where comfort, elegance, and investment returns converge.</p>","tile_image":{"url":"https://ggfx-providentestate.s3.eu-west-2.amazonaws.com/i/Feature_a0c307f757.jpg","hash":"Feature_a0c307f757","name":"Feature.jpg"},"banner_image":{"url":"https://ggfx-providentestate.s3.eu-west-2.amazonaw