</li><li>Emaar’s Proven Excellence – Delivered by a globally recognized developer known for premium design, quality, and long-term value.</li><li>Waterfront Lifestyle – Swimmable lagoon, shaded canopies, pools, and water-inspired landscapes curated for daily leisure.</li><li>Wellness-Focused Living – Spa facilities, fitness spaces, and serene pathways designed to promote wellbeing and relaxation.</li><li>Family-Centered Community – Pocket parks, playgrounds, and green corridors create a nurturing environment for families.</li><li>Spacious Luxury Villas – Contemporary 4 to 6-bedroom villas with refined interiors, expansive plots, and flowing natural light.</li><li>Attractive 10% Down Payment – Low entry commitment enhances accessibility for end-users and long-term investors.</li><li>High Capital Appreciation Potential – Strong demand and limited villa supply within The Oasis support long-term growth prospects.</li></ul>","design_title":null},"location_tile":{"id":1938,"cta":{"id":2748,"icon":null,"menu":null,"cta_label":"Get more information","isExternal":false,"custom_link":"#payment-plans"},"image":{"url":"https://ggfx-providentestate.s3.eu-west-2.amazonaws.com/i/map_Location_bca3f907d5.jpg","hash":"map_Location_bca3f907d5","name":"map-Location.jpg"},"style":null,"title":"Strategically Positioned within The Oasis","heading":"Location","bg_color":"blue","add_place":[],"image_fit":null,"img_align":"left","video_url":null,"icon_stats":[],"description":"<p>Mareva by Emaar Properties sits within The Oasis, a master community defined by lush greenery, serene waterways, and resort-inspired surroundings. Located just off Jebel Ali – Al Hibab Road (D57), it ensures smooth connectivity to Dubai’s major destinations while preserving a calm, private residential atmosphere.</p><ul><li>18 Minutes – Al Maktoum International Airport</li><li>20 Minutes – Dubai Hills Estate / Dubai Hills Mall</li><li>28 Minutes – Dubai Marina / Dubai Marina Mall</li><li>35 Minutes – Downtown Dubai /